  "id": "dev-wake-root-audit",
  "scope": "Quint controls for one native wake channel, one empty-root materialization, one foreign cleanup closure, and one marker audit: a returned wait is a recheck, an empty gate is one atomic word, three release rights stay distinct, and a join failure is not audit quiescence. Not a GSI trace, native admission, or family acceptance.",
